# Tensorial Multi-view Clustering via Alternative Rank Minimization and Inter-view Alignment
**IEEE Transactions on Knowledge and Data Engineering (TKDE), 2026**

---

## 📧 Dataset & Contact
Large-scale datasets cannot be uploaded to GitHub due to size limitations.
If you need the full datasets or have any questions about the work, please contact:
> **zskong@bjtu.edu.cn**

---

## 🔬 Core Contribution
We propose a **novel non-convex strategy** for multi-view subspace/anchor clustering, with key findings:
- Most datasets achieve the **best performance** when \( \theta = 10^{-1} \)
- A small number of datasets reach optimal performance when \( \theta = 10^{-2} \)

### Theoretical Support
- **Convergence proof**: Detailed derivation is provided in the supplementary materials
- **Approximation proof**: Rigorous theoretical analysis is presented in the main text

We welcome you to use our non-convex function in your research and hope it brings valuable results.

